{"ID":"20240118151245-c6fehjm","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151245-c6fehjm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151245-c6fehjm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151245-wgbye5z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110439-o9pwkmz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:621,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110439-o9pwkmz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:209,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:209\u0026#125;","title":"107杜仲","type":"doc","updated":"20240130101342"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151245-wgbye5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151245-wgbye5z","updated":"20240122110354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛平，主腰脊痛，补中益精气，坚筋骨强志，除阴下痒湿，小便余沥、久服轻身耐老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110358-uc8hszl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110358-uc8hszl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西四川等地，树皮中有银丝如棉，故亦名锦杜仲，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110359-0wd2unk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110359-0wd2unk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛甘，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110401-k3lqgjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110401-k3lqgjj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】杜仲为健筋骨补腰肾要药，主腰膝酸痛，体虚强直，治胎漏胎堕，精气亏弱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110402-4nsjcsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110402-4nsjcsf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】脚中酸痛，不欲践地。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110404-ln92xci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110404-ln92xci"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】肾冷膂腰痛，人虚而身强直，风也，腰不利加重。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110406-fjwdkqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110406-fjwdkqg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治肾劳腰脊挛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110408-kgzxiu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110408-kgzxiu5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【东垣】能使筋骨相着。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110409-grp2jdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110409-grp2jdl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【好古】润肝燥，补肝经风虚。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110411-bn636pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110411-bn636pu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【汪机】治胎漏胎堕。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110412-exwhpux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110412-exwhpux"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】杜仲柔韧，象人之筋膜，能伸能缩，极其坚韧，包紫黑，味纯厚，故入肝肾，以强人筋骨。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110414-3iurnwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110414-3iurnwc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二钱至三四钱，大剂二三两。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110417-08xpxyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110417-08xpxyq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】恶元参蛇蜕，肾虚火炽者忌，当知母黄柏同用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110421-wjyjt7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110421-wjyjt7g"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"常用于胎前能安，胎后能补。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110422-nuvfy64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110422-nuvfy64"}},{"ID":"20240122110423-7c7qhe1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110423-7c7qhe1"}},{"ID":"20240122110423-c401ulx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110423-c401ulx","updated":"20240130100923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第107味药，杜仲。杜仲这个药，我们使用得非常的广泛，它出产在我国陕西、四川这一带地方。它被拉起来的树皮，杜仲的树皮，你看到这是杜仲啊，杜仲药材蛮贵，那我们如何知道真伪？这杜仲皮，如果你把它拉起来，看到没有，有白丝，看到没有？真的杜仲，一劈就干了，是假的杜仲。怎么劈它都有那个白丝，是真的杜仲。那诸位看看这个相，妇科常用杜仲，你看里面的丝拉得很紧，对不对？你们试试看，拉得很紧。女孩子生完小孩以后，妊娠纹很难看嘛，所以妇科用得很多，除了怀孕，收妊娠纹就靠杜仲那个粘丝那个拉力，因为它那个丝比较紧跟粘，所以又叫做锦杜仲。"}]},{"ID":"20240122110431-auk458v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110431-auk458v","updated":"20240130101205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个是滋补的药，补中益气的药，味辛甘，味辛甘发散，辛甘发散，它是辛甘为阳，也是阳药，所以又有辛味又有甘味就是阳药。那腰背痛，女人的腰脊痛都可以用，所以杜仲是补筋骨壮腰肾的药，背后、腰背后痛、关节痛、坐骨神经痛都可以使用杜仲，尤其是女孩子生了小孩子腰酸背痛。这个女孩子生了小孩子腰酸背痛，除了生产的经过会伤到以外，还有就是年轻的妈妈不懂，就是抱小孩子，小孩子在那边哭，她就抖，她背后命门在那边摇，前面在这边抖，很多女孩子因为抖太久了，弄得腰受伤，那个都可以用杜仲。"}]},{"ID":"20240122110439-o9pwkmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110439-o9pwkmz","updated":"20240130101342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说我们这个桑寄生安胎，杜仲能够补筋骨，常常会和在一起一块儿使用。唐容川他说杜仲这个韧劲像人的筋骨，能伸能缩，极其坚韧，包紫黑，味纯厚，故入肝肾，这个强筋骨的力量很强，不单单是女人的妇科在用，骨头断，骨折啊基本上都在用杜仲，它的力量很强。我们看最后一行他说胎前能够安胎，胎后能够补，补妈妈。胎后吃了以后女人的妊娠纹可以收得很快，临床上看的时候根本看不出生过，整个小肚子平的，好消息嘛，这是妇女的好消息嘛，这个妊娠纹你怎么不早讲？！那等她吃吃看看有没有效果，所以我常常跟他说啊，有药啊都不讲。药怎么来的？以意得的，这是杜仲。"}]}]}